      "q": "Who is the largest small-business federal contractor in FY2027?",
      "a": "CSI AVIATION, INC is the largest small-business federal contractor in FY2027 to date. CSI AVIATION, INC obligated $278M in FY2027 to date, which is the highest single-firm obligation on the ranked list."
